        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2007-11-30/pdf/07-5919.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishment of Emergency Board (Board) . There is established, \neffective 12:01 a.m. eastern standard time on December 1, 2007, a Board \nof five members to be appointed by the President to investigate and report \non these disputes. No member shall be pecuniarily or otherwise interested \nin any organization of railroad employees or any carrier. The Board shall \nperform its functions subject to the availability of funds."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2219,
      "char_start": 2102,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13452#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13452#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "72 FR 67827, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "223678e922ec6b0bc213d98534fc1c93176c62b54b7a4ea1606b18efbf460e84",
        "signing_date": "2007-11-28",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13452.txt",
        "text_sha256": "eef0f96e3894f7471a2f24e076c1f8c04d13dc08ac9b42cb474061c4c0e5c2ba",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2007-11-30/pdf/07-5919.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report. The Board shall report to the President with respect to \nthe disputes within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2558,
      "char_start": 2221,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:13452#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 1,
      "scope_id": "EO:13452#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "72 FR 67827, PDF pages 1-3",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "223678e922ec6b0bc213d98534fc1c93176c62b54b7a4ea1606b18efbf460e84",
        "signing_date": "2007-11-28",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_13452.txt",
        "text_sha256": "eef0f96e3894f7471a2f24e076c1f8c04d13dc08ac9b42cb474061c4c0e5c2ba",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2007-11-30/pdf/07-5919.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. Maintaining Conditions . As provided by section 10 of the RLA, \nfrom the date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board \nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out \nof which the disputes arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy, \nexcept by agreement of the parties."
    },
