        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-2007-11-30/pdf/07-5919.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 4. Records Maintenance. The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board. \nVerDate Aug<31>2005 16:37 Nov 29, 2007 Jkt 214001 PO 00000 Frm 00003 Fmt 4705 Sfmt 4790 E:\\FR\\FM\\30NOD0.SGM 30NOD0rwilkins on PROD1PC63 with MISCELLANEOUS\n=== PDF page 2 of 3 ===\n67828 Federal Register / Vol. 72, No. 230 / Friday, November 30, 2007 / Presidential Documents"
    },
